Voltage and current controlled sampling of a ramp
* Provenance: original circuit for Sansho release-prep verification.
Vin in 0 PWL(0 0 20u 1)
Vgate drive 0 PULSE(0 2 2u 1u 1u 4u 10u)
Vsense drive gate 0
Rgate gate 0 1k
Ssample in held gate 0 sample
Wsample in copy Vsense mirror
.model sample SW(ron=50 roff=1g vt=1 vh=0.2)
.model mirror CSW(ron=50 roff=1g it=1m ih=0.2m)
Cstore held 0 2n
Ccopy copy 0 2n
.tran 50n 20u 0 10n
.end
